    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Collaborative, independent Swiss type foundry (Maxitype Sarl), based in Geneva, founded 2020. A collective rather than a single-designer foundry: contributors include Maximage, Eurostandard, Jakub Samek, Marietta Eugster and others (~12+ named collaborators per their About page). Catalog of ~14 typeface families sold per style (CHF), two free. Established, well-regarded research-driven foundry; treat as a studio/collective for Work Status. Selecta (the clipped typeface) is one of their families. Sources: their own site (about-us, shop).",
